sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant R as Resource server
  participant A as Authorization server
  C->>R: GET /mcp
  R-->>C: 401, WWW-Authenticate points to /.well-known/oauth-protected-resource
  C->>R: GET /.well-known/oauth-protected-resource
  R-->>C: authorization_servers: https://auth.example.com/realms/main
  C->>A: discover, register, authorize with PKCE
  Note over C,A: Token audience is https://resource.example.com/mcp/v1/endpoint
  A-->>C: access_token
